## 三、条件构造器
### 3.1 QueryWrapper
```java
// QueryWrapper：传统写法
QueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new QueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq("age", 25)                    // age = 25
.like("user_name", "tom")         // user_name LIKE '%tom%'
.between("create_time", start, end) // create_time BETWEEN start AND end
.orderByDesc("create_time")        // ORDER BY create_time DESC
.last("LIMIT 10");                 // 拼接SQL末尾
List<User> users = userMapper.selectList(wrapper);
// 条件查询
QueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new QueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq(status != null, "status", status)  // 条件为true才拼接
.like(StringUtils.isNotBlank(name), "user_name", name);
// 只查询指定列
wrapper.select("id", "user_name", "age");
// 分组
wrapper.groupBy("status");
// 子查询
wrapper.inSql("id", "SELECT user_id FROM order WHERE amount > 100");
```
### 3.2 LambdaQueryWrapper（推荐）
```java
// LambdaQueryWrapper：类型安全，避免硬编码列名
LambdaQueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq(User::getAge, 25)                    // age = 25
.like(User::getUserName, "tom")          // user_name LIKE '%tom%'
.between(User::getCreateTime, start, end) // create_time BETWEEN start AND end
.orderByDesc(User::getCreateTime);        // ORDER BY create_time DESC
List<User> users = userMapper.selectList(wrapper);
// 条件构造
LambdaQueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq(status != null, User::getStatus, status)
.like(StringUtils.isNotBlank(name), User::getUserName, name)
.ge(minAge != null, User::getAge, minAge)
.le(maxAge != null, User::getAge, maxAge);
// 链式调用
List<User> users = new LambdaQueryChainWrapper<>(userMapper)
.eq(User::getStatus, 1)
.like(User::getUserName, "tom")
.orderByDesc(User::getCreateTime)
.list();
```
### 3.3 UpdateWrapper
```java
// UpdateWrapper：更新操作
UpdateWrapper<User> wrapper = new UpdateWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq("id", 1L)
.set("user_name", "newName")
.set("age", 26);
userMapper.update(null, wrapper);
// LambdaUpdateWrapper
LambdaUpdateWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaUpdateWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq(User::getId, 1L)
.set(User::getUserName, "newName")
.set(User::getAge, 26);
userMapper.update(null, wrapper);
```
## 四、分页插件
### 4.1 配置分页插件
```java
@Configuration
public class MybatisPlusConfig {
@Bean
public MybatisPlusInterceptor mybatisPlusInterceptor() {
MybatisPlusInterceptor interceptor = new MybatisPlusInterceptor();
// 添加分页插件
interceptor.addInnerInterceptor(new PaginationInnerInterceptor(DbType.MYSQL));
return interceptor;
}
}
```
### 4.2 使用分页
```java
// Mapper分页
IPage<User> page = new Page<>(1, 10);  // 第1页，每页10条
IPage<User> result = userMapper.selectPage(page, wrapper);
// result.getRecords()  → 当前页数据
// result.getTotal()    → 总记录数
// result.getPages()    → 总页数
// result.getCurrent()  → 当前页码
// result.getSize()     → 每页大小
// Service分页
IPage<User> page = userService.page(new Page<>(1, 10), wrapper);
```
### 4.3 自定义SQL分页
```java
// Mapper接口
@Mapper
public interface UserMapper extends BaseMapper<User> {
@Select("SELECT u.*, o.order_count FROM user u " +
"LEFT JOIN (SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) as order_count FROM orders GROUP BY user_id) o " +
"ON u.id = o.user_id")
IPage<UserVO> selectUserWithOrderCount(IPage<UserVO> page);
}
```
## 五、代码生成器
```java
// MyBatis-Plus 3.5.x 代码生成器
public class CodeGenerator {
public static void main(String[] args) {
FastAutoGenerator.create("jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/mydb", "root", "123456")
// 全局配置
.globalConfig(builder -> builder
.author("developer")
.outputDir("src/main/java")
.disableOpenDir()
)
// 包配置
.packageConfig(builder -> builder
.parent("com.example")
.moduleName("demo")
.entity("entity")
.mapper("mapper")
.service("service")
.controller("controller")
)
// 策略配置
.strategyConfig(builder -> builder
.addInclude("user", "order", "product")  // 需要生成的表
.entityBuilder()
.enableLombok()
.enableTableFieldAnnotation()
.mapperBuilder()
.enableMapperAnnotation()
.serviceBuilder()
.formatServiceFileName("%sService")
.controllerBuilder()
.enableRestStyle()
)
.templateEngine(new FreemarkerTemplateEngine())
.execute();
}
}
```
## 六、其他常用功能
### 6.1 主键策略
```java
public enum IdType {
AUTO(0),       // 数据库自增
NONE(1),       // 无策略，跟随全局
INPUT(2),      // 手动输入
ASSIGN_ID(3),  // 雪花算法（默认）
ASSIGN_UUID(4) // UUID
}
// 使用
@TableId(type = IdType.ASSIGN_ID)
private Long id;
```
